      "text": "I'll start by reviewing the repository. I've read all the files — now let me analyze each ticket:\n\n**#215** (`paths.py`): `qualify()` ignores its `schema` parameter and hardcodes `\"public\"` instead of using `WORK_SCHEMA` (\"staging\"). Clear bug.\n\n**#219** (`retry.py`): `call_with_retry` never retries — it just calls `fn()` once.\n\n**#223** (`router.py`): `categorize` lowercases the text, but the `transformation`/`data_quality` patterns contain capital letters (`\\bJoin\\b`, `\\bVerify\\b`...), so they can never match.\n\n**#224** (`format.py`): `.encode(\"ascii\")` raises `UnicodeEncodeError` on non-ASCII names.\n\n**#212** (`guardrails.py`): needs a real policy design.\n\nLet me write the fixes, starting with the straightforward ones:",
